# z96a-v2: the DRM stack is deliberately NOT loaded in the initramfs.
# U-Boot hands over a live scanout with the Alkaid logo on screen; a DRM
# probe/modeset here would wipe it and leave a black screen until the splash
# reaches its first bright frame.  The rootfs udev (or slim's modprobe) brings
# rockchipdrm up later, so the logo stays visible until that modeset.
usb-storage
sd_mod
scsi_mod
xhci-hcd
ext4
jbd2
crc32c
pwm_bl
rtc_rk808
